      {
        "h_title": "Camping and rafthouses in Khao Sok",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A night on Chiew Lan Lake is worth the expense and many travellers recall it as one of the most memorable and calming experiences from their trips to Thailand. You’ll also find various types of campgrounds, including points deep in the jungle that require overnight treks to reach.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Chiew Lan Lake rafthouses",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "You glide off in a kayak on water hued like molten emerald as mist shrouds immense towers of limestone. A grey-headed eagle launches from a crag, honing in on a school of fish whose scales shine scarlet in the chalky light. Welcome to dawn on Chiew Lan Lake, where rafthouse lodgings run by Khao Sok National Park and local families float amid the breathtaking scenery.\nAt least 17... Read our full story.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/6741",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/6741",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full story."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Chiew Lan Lake rafthouses",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/6741",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/6741",
                "anchor_text": "Chiew Lan Lake rafthouses"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Camping in Khao Sok National Park",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "While more visitors to Khao Sok tend to stay in accommodation that actually has walls, if you prefer camping to be that little bit closer to nature, there are plenty of options—don’t think you need to restrict yourself solely to the National Park.\nThe small park-run campground is set between the two main trailheads, next to headquarters and an easy stroll from the village at the... Read our full review of Camping in Khao Sok National Park including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/5215",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/5215",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Camping in Khao Sok National Park including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Camping in Khao Sok National Park",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/5215",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/5215",
                "anchor_text": "Camping in Khao Sok National Park"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khlong Sok village (near park headquarters)",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "This mountain-rimmed village hosts the bulk of lodgings and tourist services for Khao Sok, as well as the national park headquarters. Those seeking a dorm will find a few little air-con hostels—Secret and Coco both looked fine—although some resorts offer private rooms for as low as 300 baht.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Our Jungle House",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "With spacious treehouses set in a serene riverside setting at the foot of a cliff, the truly eco-conscious Our Jungle House and its newer sister, Our Jungle Camp, are top spots in Khao Sok. Found at the end of a 700-metre lane off the main access road to park headquarters, these two neighbouring properties combine to offer a wonderful collection of treehouses and more typical... Read our full review of Our Jungle House including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/khao_sok_national_park/all/6742",
            "urls": [
