            "text": "Long-running Khao Sok Treehouse Resort is the place to pretend you’re a guest of the ents or ewoks in rooms set high up amid the treetops. After passing reception and a really tall steel tower with narrow footbridges up by the road, steep steps lead up to a series of steel walkways roped to wood-panel floors—safe but not recommended if you’re prone to vertigo or heavy drinking. Down... Read our full review of Khao Sok Treehouse Resort including room rates and direct contact details.",
