      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok valley",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Khao Sok National Park",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Quite a few resorts are found along the 65-km highway that follows the Sok River between Khlong Sok village and the jumping off point for Chiew Lan Lake. If you have time and a vehicle, Cliff and River is worth a night to enjoy the marvellous setting. Further east, Baan Anurak Community Lodge’s 1,000-baht bungalows are also worth a look for a more locally immersive stay.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
